<Project>

  <!-- Imported by Directory.Build.props into every SOLVER project (the names in $(FsSolverProjects)); no other project sees any of this.
       Plan: docs/plans/dotnet-option-b-plan.md rule 5 (determinism), 10.4 (coding rules), card T0.4.

       What a solver project gets:
         1. Microsoft.CodeAnalysis.BannedApiAnalyzers (RS0030) with ../BannedSymbols.txt: no System.Math/MathF members but Abs Sqrt Floor Ceiling
            Truncate CopySign Min Max; no Math.Round, FusedMultiplyAdd, TensorPrimitives, Vector<T>, Vector128.Sum/Dot, *Native members.
            Card T0.4b: also no hardware FMA through X86.Fma / AdvSimd / Sve / Avx512F intrinsics, no Convert.To* of a float or double (or of an object),
            Convert.ChangeType, and no int.CreateTruncating / CreateSaturating / CreateChecked (any integer type, INumberBase<T>).
            Card T0.4c: also no platform intrinsics at all (the namespaces System.Runtime.Intrinsics.X86, .Arm, .Wasm), no Vector64/128/256/512.ConvertToInt32/Int64/
            UInt32/UInt64, no ConvertToInteger on double/float/Half/decimal, no decimal.ToInt32 and siblings.
         2. The FS0001 analyzer (Fs.Analyzers): no explicit float/double to integer cast; since T0.4c also none from Half or decimal to an integer, from decimal to
            float/double/Half, to Int128/UInt128/BigInteger, or hidden in foreach (int x in doubles).
         3. Both rules are ERRORS and only FsMath.cs, FsConv.cs (by file name) and Fs.Kernel/ThirdParty/ are exempt (since card T1.4b nothing else, Fs.Kernel/Pyrogenic/ included): see ../.editorconfig (an analyzer config
            file at the root applies to every project below it, but only a solver project runs the analyzers, so it changes nothing elsewhere).
       The rules are off in Fs.Bench, Fs.Transport, Fs.TestApp, Fs.Host, Fs.Results, Fs.Tests (they are not solver code). -->

  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.CodeAnalysis.BannedApiAnalyzers" Version="5.6.0" PrivateAssets="all" />
    <AdditionalFiles Include="$(MSBuildThisFileDirectory)..\BannedSymbols.txt" Link="BannedSymbols.txt" />
    <ProjectReference Include="$(MSBuildThisFileDirectory)Fs.Analyzers.csproj" OutputItemType="Analyzer" ReferenceOutputAssembly="false" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
